 ## Operational notes
 
-- **Multi-page raster PDF**: WASM path may degrade vs Docker sidecar (`protein-chain-bd/scripts/veridyn-ocr-service`). For maximal parity deploy that sidecar and point **`VERIDYN_OCR_URL`** at it.
