The independent review found one material provenance edge case: a local dirty build could embed clean `HEAD` and overclaim that commit as the artifact source. I’m closing it by making production builds fail when they must fall back to Git and the worktree is dirty; developer/test commands explicitly allow a local-only dirty fallback. The review’s fresh-clone dev concern was already addressed with `predev`.
