- (a) Chose the honest reference-only UI because an unauthenticated server-key proxy would create a public API relay. Browser API calls and live/production labels were removed; audits corrected.
- (b) Claims now state Vercel uses configured Vertex, Gemini, or OpenRouter vision OCR. `tesseract.js` is only a non-Vercel fallback.
- (c) Prebuild generates a commit constant from Vercel/CI SHA or clean Git HEAD. Dirty fallback builds fail; health uses the constant when runtime SHA is absent.
- Tests: 64/64 unit/integrity passed, 5/5 focused honesty tests passed, 1/1 compiled-health test passed, 0 failures. Three credential-gated live probes were skipped. Typecheck passed; production build completed all 12 routes.
- PR: https://github.com/saadmanhuq-code/veridyn-ocr-dialect-service/pull/30
